    "abstract": "Parts breakdown of the forward cargo compartment lining, covering the ceiling and sidewall panels, the compartment light assemblies, the trim strip and the loading system panels behind them.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure gives the parts breakdown of the forward cargo compartment lining installation and the light assemblies and trim that are removed with it.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the left-hand side of the compartment looking outboard. The sidewall panel at item 10 exists in two forms: the delivered panel and the panel with the moulded return that traps an attenuation blanket. Both carry the same part number because the return was introduced within the same drawing issue; use the issue letter on the panel label to tell them apart when ordering."
    },
